{
  "_meta": {
    "notes": "The loss RP-1's own dismantle dialog names nowhere. It asks 'This cannot be undone!' and says nothing about what is undone: the complex's earned build efficiency, which RP-1 rates on a RECORD rather than on a complex. Delete the last complex on a record and the record is cleared, so a rebuild starts from RP-1's floor and climbs back over months of career time. Whether that happens at all depends on something an operator cannot see without being told, which is why these are two different sentences rather than one hedged one."
  },
